  "material_learning": "The 0.50 recovery gate reduced Design drawdown by 16.87 percentage points and removed three terminal lots, but did so by excluding 124 of 186 parent signals and losing 65.34 USDT of realized Design PnL. In Validation it lost 12.37 USDT of total PnL, worsened drawdown by 1.83 percentage points, almost doubled P90 holding from 1418.3 to 2696.6 hours, and had only two positive annual folds. Both frozen neighbors also underperformed Validation total PnL, so the result is not a threshold cliff that warrants tuning.",
